@startuml Booking Flow Sequence Diagram

!theme plain

actor Guest
participant "KioskController" as Kiosk
participant "KioskRoomSelectionHelper" as KRSH
participant "KioskLoyaltyHelper" as KLH
participant "ReservationService" as RS
participant "RoomSuggestion" as RoomSug
participant "GuestRepository" as GR
participant "RoomRepository" as RR
participant "BillingService" as BS
participant "LoyaltyService" as LS
participant "Database" as DB

== Guest Details Entry ==
Guest -> Kiosk: Enter guest details (name, email, phone)
Kiosk -> Kiosk: Validate input fields
Kiosk -> GR: Find or create guest
GR -> DB: Query guest by email/phone
DB --> GR: Guest entity (or null)
alt Guest not found
    GR -> DB: Create new guest
    DB --> GR: New guest entity
end
GR --> Kiosk: Guest object

== Optional Loyalty Enrollment ==
Guest -> Kiosk: Click "Enroll in Loyalty"
Kiosk -> KLH: enrollInLoyaltyFromGuestDetails(guest)
KLH -> KLH: Show confirmation dialog\nwith guest information
Guest -> KLH: Confirm enrollment
KLH -> LS: enrollGuest(guest)
LS -> DB: Save guest with loyalty number
DB --> LS: Guest updated
LS --> KLH: Loyalty number
KLH --> Kiosk: Enrollment successful
Kiosk --> Guest: Show loyalty number

== Room Selection ==
Guest -> Kiosk: Select dates and number of guests
Kiosk -> RS: suggestRooms(numAdults, numChildren, checkIn, checkOut)
RS -> RR: getAvailableRooms(roomType, checkIn, checkOut)
RR -> DB: Query available rooms
DB --> RR: Room list
RR --> RS: Available rooms

alt Total people > 4
    RS -> RS: Calculate combination suggestions\n(double + single rooms)
    RS -> RoomSug: new RoomSuggestion(primaryRoom, primaryQty,\nsecondaryRoomType, secondaryQty)
    RoomSug --> RS: Combination suggestion
else Total people <= 4
    RS -> RoomSug: new RoomSuggestion(room, quantity)
    RoomSug --> RS: Single room suggestion
end

RS --> Kiosk: List<RoomSuggestion>
Kiosk -> KRSH: loadRoomSuggestionsIntoTable(suggestions)
KRSH -> KRSH: Display suggestions in table\n(handles combinations)

Guest -> Kiosk: Select room suggestion
Kiosk -> KRSH: processAcceptedSuggestion(suggestion)
alt Suggestion is combination
    KRSH -> RR: getAvailableRooms(primaryRoomType)
    RR --> KRSH: Primary rooms
    KRSH -> RR: getAvailableRooms(secondaryRoomType)
    RR --> KRSH: Secondary rooms
    KRSH -> KRSH: Combine primary and secondary rooms
else Single room type
    KRSH -> RR: getAvailableRooms(roomType)
    RR --> KRSH: Rooms
end
KRSH --> Kiosk: List<Room> selectedRooms

== Add-ons Selection ==
Guest -> Kiosk: Select add-ons
Kiosk -> Kiosk: Calculate add-on prices

== Booking Confirmation ==
Guest -> Kiosk: Confirm booking
Kiosk -> RS: validateDates(checkIn, checkOut)
RS --> Kiosk: Dates valid
Kiosk -> RS: validateOccupancy(rooms, numAdults, numChildren)
RS --> Kiosk: Occupancy valid

Kiosk -> RS: createReservation(guest, rooms, addons, dates)
RS -> RR: Check room availability
RR -> DB: Verify room status
DB --> RR: Room status
RR --> RS: Rooms available

RS -> RS: Create Reservation entity
RS -> RS: Create ReservationRoom entities
RS -> RS: Create ReservationAddon entities
RS -> DB: Save reservation
DB --> RS: Reservation saved

RS -> BS: createBilling(reservation, subtotal)
BS -> BS: Calculate tax
BS -> BS: Calculate total using BillingStrategy
BS -> DB: Save billing
DB --> BS: Billing saved
BS --> RS: Billing object

RS -> DB: Update room status to OCCUPIED
DB --> RS: Rooms updated
RS --> Kiosk: Reservation created

== Optional Deposit at Booking ==
alt Guest pays deposit
    Guest -> Kiosk: Pay deposit
    Kiosk -> BS: createDeposit(billing, method, amount, actor)
    BS -> BS: processPayment(billing, method, amount, actor)
    BS -> DB: Save payment
    DB --> BS: Payment saved
    BS -> DB: Update billing (paidAmount, balanceAmount)
    DB --> BS: Billing updated
    BS --> Kiosk: Payment processed
end

Kiosk -> Guest: Show confirmation with reservation number

@enduml
